==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
Of {{der|eo|gmw}} origin, ultimately from {{der|eo|gmw-pro|[[*liʀnēn]], [[*liʀnōn]]||to learn}}. Compare {{cog|de|lernen}}, {{cog|en|learn}}, {{cog|yi|לערנען}}; also distantly related to {{cog|nl|leren}}.

